ARC or PLC in Dane County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/dane-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Dane County, June to July and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025, the middle of the grids had January to February at 35% of normal and September to October at 49%. June to July is the wettest pair at 8.82 inches normal, and January to February is the driest at 2.39 inches.</p>"}
